# Whitelist: ignore everything, then re-admit only code and documentation.
# This repo holds METHODS. Data lives in S3 (see README).
*
!*/
# code
!*.sh
!*.py
# documentation
!*.md
# small text results that document what each stage produced
!SUMMARY_*.txt
!LENGTH_HIST.txt
!.gitignore
